       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَوْلٌ زَعِقٌ</span> <i>Vehement terror.</i> (TA.) ＝   
